@startuml flashCard
actor User
participant "Router" as R
participant "FlashCard.controller" as C
participant "FlashCard.service" as S
participant "FlashCardPlanModel" as MPlan
participant "FlashCardAttemptModel" as MAttempt
participant "VocabularyModel" as MVocab
participant "DayStudy.service" as DayS

'=== GET /history/:topicId ===
User -> R: GET /history/:topicId
R -> C: getHistoryFlashCardByTopic()
C -> S: getHistoryFlashCardByTopicService(topicId,userId)
S -> MAttempt: aggregate([... lookup vocabularies ...])
MAttempt --> S: history
S --> C: history
C -> R: JSON
R --> User: response

'=== GET /:id ===
User -> R: GET /:id
R -> C: getFlashCardById()
C -> S: getFlashCardByIdService(id)
S -> MPlan: aggregate([ lookup topic -> lookup vocabularies ])
MPlan --> S: topic + vocabularies
S --> C: data
C -> R: JSON
R --> User: response

'=== POST /submit ===
User -> R: POST /submit { flashCardAttempt, logs, ... }
R -> C: submitFlashCard()
C -> S: submitFlashCardService(flashCardAttemptFull)
S -> MAttempt: create(attempt)
MAttempt --> S: result
S --> C: result
C -> R: JSON 201
R --> User: response

note right of DayS: Controller may call DayStudy service to unlock next
@enduml
